WEBVTT

00:15.217 --> 00:15.457
You.

00:40.162 --> 00:45.485
A thousand miles of winter grey. Another dawn,

00:45.505 --> 00:51.369
another day. The engines hum, a weary soul. A

00:51.429 --> 00:56.613
heavy price, a heavy toll. I see your face on

00:56.713 --> 01:03.018
frozen glass. A man that's built to last A single

01:03.178 --> 01:08.444
light that I must find To leave the endless dark

01:08.524 --> 01:11.146
behind

01:11.847 --> 01:18.634
And the lights are bright On this winter's night

01:18.674 --> 01:24.340
Because you're coming home Yes, you're finally

01:24.400 --> 01:30.465
coming home Through the wind and rain Through

01:30.485 --> 01:38.311
the doubt and pain You are not alone No, you're

01:38.451 --> 01:45.657
finally No, you're finally coming

01:48.519 --> 01:56.447
home Jumps down the ladder, about to be raised Up

01:56.487 --> 02:00.849
the mountain, but no more than a whispered vow

02:01.289 --> 02:06.252
Feels so close, it's coming now The fire's lit,

02:06.613 --> 02:12.656
the table's set A promise that I haven't met But

02:12.756 --> 02:16.919
in my heart, the feeling grows A warmth that

02:16.999 --> 02:19.180
melts the winter snow

02:21.949 --> 02:28.714
And the lights are bright On this winter's night

02:28.794 --> 02:34.478
Because you're coming home Yes, you're finally

02:34.518 --> 02:40.742
coming home Through the wind and rain Through

02:40.782 --> 02:48.467
the doubt and pain You are not alone No, you're

02:48.608 --> 02:50.729
finally coming

02:55.902 --> 02:56.302
you.

04:05.210 --> 04:12.093
And the lights are bright on this winter's night

04:12.173 --> 04:17.856
Because you're coming home Yes, you're finally

04:17.916 --> 04:24.119
coming home Through the wind and rain Through

04:24.179 --> 04:31.831
